{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1000_p", "source_sha256": "331795f9822b55dc94c039c2a24cebfb0d48c57cac50ac39479c78aa350a1281", "ja": "（今日は『新社会人応援CM』の撮影日。新入社員役\nとして抜擢された翼は、見事撮影をやり切ってくれた）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄《为初入社会的新人加油》的广告。被选为新员工角色的翼，出色地完成了拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "faa9d04b491cb9cfa716dc2058044d51c03afa9f60a387c1b3050c1c407a8185", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでーす♪\nわたしのバリキャリっぷり、見ててくれましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦♪  \n你有看到我干练女强人的样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4d414db0808e59cfa020a588e199feedfcd0b43dfbdcfe8d269e3dbf951911b4", "ja": "ああ！　とても様になってたよ。\n名刺の渡し方もバッチリだったな！", "zh": "啊！看起来很像那么回事。\n递名片的方式也做得很漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c70723aa84ffae7dd644a2e2808ceb47c9659f8d22f289ee6908aaf9b2e91666", "ja": "ありがとうございま～す♪　スタッフさんにも、\nいっぱい褒めてもらったんですよ。", "zh": "谢谢你们～♪ 工作人员也夸了我好多次呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3f54396f5f4eb44fdb8630048518413d09260df99310b6663a90a5f8384ab98", "ja": "「営業の仕事、向いてるね！」って♪\n{$P$}さんも、そう思いますか？", "zh": "“很适合跑外务的工作呢！”这样♪\n{$P$}先生也这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a9c9ff82a6118756b0d4bcf158b156ff751dc4113b4fc430e8056aac74df11c0", "ja": "そうだな。翼はお願い上手……というか、\nおねだり上手だし。向いてるかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊。翼很会拜托别人……或者说，很会撒娇。说不定还真挺适合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "16aa0e27e43a1ede240d131b06231ef0fa62b5db327bb4810feec2627395adba", "ja": "そっか～。もし、わたしがアイドルになってなかったら\nそういう未来があったかもしれませんね。", "zh": "这样啊～。如果我没成为偶像，说不定也会有那样的未来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "024dd1af4ee86730848f0761d4cf51654e4c210b22d491576a9031da27065482", "ja": "{$P$}さんに営業とかしたり……\nなーんて！", "zh": "向{$P$}先生做做推销什么的……开玩笑啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3aecce72ab7543ecef9c232d70c831a454b2eed2d80ffa1efdbd64c92fff8429", "ja": "翼からの営業か。\n……なんだか断れる自信がないな。", "zh": "这是翼来拉业务吗。\n……总觉得自己没信心拒绝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bf7b293b4737dd806986dfa40f830aa75a67be9123c569455a742c8c81ebced9", "ja": "えへへ。わたしも、売り込む自信しかないですよ♪\nやっぱり営業のお仕事って、天職かも♪", "zh": "嘿嘿。我也只有推销的自信哦♪\n果然，跑业务的工作说不定就是为我量身定做的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1010_p", "source_sha256": "185808bde092f3003c9cf395b4ab0cfcd2450c08d11ae0b1f69af22460f0dcd9", "ja": "はは、そうだな。けど……もしそうなったら、\n仕事の話だけで、打ち合わせは終わらないだろうなぁ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。不过……要是真变成那样，光聊工作，商量肯定是不会结束的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1012_p", "source_sha256": "744d2269cc3b4891b47bb29783672254178a6fac1beaab8bf07029a4607f4010", "ja": "きっと、スカウトすると思うんだ。\n「アイドルに興味ありませんか？」って。", "zh": "我觉得肯定会去挖人的。\n然后说：“你对成为偶像有兴趣吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "77141adc1a6a41e0e16bce40eeef83672a6d957fb064d926e3aa95e6137a3202", "ja": "ええ！　それって……{$P$}さんから\n営業されちゃうってことですか～？", "zh": "诶！那就是说……会被{$P$}先生挖去当偶像吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f30a0be8fbe3ce897ad3e508bfb4854d7ec19d4573d0746060e3fb62f4472b4f", "ja": "うん。それに翼も、アイドルに興味をもってくれる\n気がするんだ。……まあ、多分の話だけど。", "zh": "嗯。而且我觉得，翼似乎也会对偶像产生兴趣。……不过，也只是我的猜测。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "43159ea4d5be2f19cfd084dc69870b95b8c5c62a6734e4a6a1c6f0484e347e13", "ja": "ん～、たしかに……そうかも。どんなお仕事をしても\nモテモテハッピーライフは、わたしの目標ですから！", "zh": "嗯～，确实……也许吧。不管做什么工作，受欢迎的幸福生活都是我的目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0493_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f2ec5181fd81058730e4973fb283061b67f548b8393bcea4d32f2fdbde256b82", "ja": "……うん！　そう考えると、やっぱり\nアイドルがわたしの天職なのかも！　えへへ♪", "zh": "……嗯！这么一想，当偶像\n果然还是我的天职呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
